<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-10-15T23:44:51.846Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 23:44:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq's parliament has appointed US-sanctioned Laith al-Khazali as deputy prime minister, signaling continued political influence of sanctioned figures. Iraqi authorities have publicly pledged that Iraqi territory will not be used for attacks on Saudi Arabia, while Kataib Hezbollah warned it will target hostile aircraft over Iraq. Security forces have dismantled two human-trafficking networks, rescuing newborns, and foiled a ring selling infants. ISIS activity appears to be regrouping in Iraq following the US withdrawal. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxONm9md2lxTWQ2OHhpbWV0TGVpVHNvRE94ejRhQmFaejFzOEFwNzF5ZG1YbXI4MDVJQU9UMGtZdEo4dUxmQ25Vc2Q3OU9qM1hWWDg4UTRoX3FSLTRxa1h3OFBFZnR2WGF1OUVtcEtNZ2dtRlpZQkpBdjF1NE9tdk93RGpRaGtfQnJYbktVeUQ4eGlXcjZHR2RmZHQtX1pVNWZ5Yi11TTdZSTFpdHBmcWItR29YM2xrSEVha0ZST2dTTnBFNkE1U2VvWk1rQnU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiQkFVX3lxTFBhUjJqTmVjUUVzSnIzYW9tVnQtVGxYV0YxcWZfYmNyMnBNZUljdEZLRkU4dmpfbjFPTURxcnJfbFRPZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;الحرة&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQZHpGM2hNbmVIV1NuVzhyd3hrX2wxbG9reWNKXzlRanV3Q3N0akZ0ZkxSejA0VnZpN1lnUDhrejQyUTJJbXR1RGdZbVBweUdKaGp6OVdrazR5VElLVlp3NXUzc1RLbXFjWE0yZElrbGZRMHhfOS1peWJxZjdNS0ZQd3dPRm14dV9vR3BMRU1scGhRU3JKWE10YVFqemlyOGRnU0RNWlJEdWFFYWh5bnlWOHRSMXIydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPVFREaFBmSDVyRHpiN0h1WFVYZ1gxbEtSbHBHNEZUX2lEUzNkNkdEUzl3OWk4YW9wd0xWYWFaMkFuUzFsNmNHeGZkdGNhekdSTXZoUWhjM3dTakNyY1FaYU